{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_010_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:016e6b1870696be9fbea3525e4006d357cb3c58f0d19af137167087f55810116",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b14abbceb1567cd7a3160c8753c4c6c5e0a76b163026de44eece1842ae785236",
      "text": "我平时总是让●●●●プロデューサー\n教我各种各样的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c16f8599cc9ebb19fa97aa3d0282b15535e82941d7852d9237a8a6a4c169665",
      "text": "我会跳华尔兹。所以，\n我可以教●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cfe3fee5bcbc7f8e42885aa8261c5143767fede0d27b99d0d42e78ddbffa37",
      "text": "站起来，●●●●プロデューサー。\n跟我一起跳华尔兹吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93b8bf10cc5f6ffc17ef640a673fc8841f39852342a872270cb809bcf23bdf0b",
      "text": "好、好的。……在事务所里跳舞，\n总觉得有点害羞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac1e34e8c0f667271a6622df0c1d7ed654700323d6ff28af090a2ea5b5d66fa",
      "text": "呵呵！不用觉得害羞！\n觉得跳舞很开心的心情，才是最重要的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34a6092ebd26f2f1f90b83f4b15b257c677eb3ebaf6fce4f90995f416e22b957",
      "text": "配合我的节奏，跳起来好吗？\nUn, deux, trois。Un, deux, trois……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118c1f321921adaf53fea10d4680bd2df45c3f1126bac8c3bb67538103a999f4",
      "text": "是这样吗？\nUn, deux, trois……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6e6d57ca23b8b953462ca0f2711ee2d7e2c975a33d009c5f6c67e89f83c5eed",
      "text": "嗯，太棒了！\n●●●●プロデューサー，跳得真好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c988a8eb96cba81dc9becd77c1185093224cd6c55f1ee05193d120e558503944",
      "text": "（……太好了。●●●●プロデューサー脸上带着笑容\n在跳呢。跳舞也是带来笑容的魔法）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34f57abc2cea249b3baaa0a211d000ea3c766f7d40577f26e094835d78df53e1",
      "text": "（真希望有朝一日，我的祖国也能\n充满像你这样的笑容啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
